msgid "Learning outcomes {#learning-outcomes}"
msgstr "Learning outcomes {#learning-outcomes}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After going through this tutorial, users should understand:\n"
"- What propagated noise absorption (PNA) is, and how it mitigates two-qubit gate noise by absorbing learned inverse noise channels into the measured observable\n"
"- How to use [`samplomatic`](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic) to box and annotate circuit layers for twirling, basis changes, and noise injection\n"
"- How to learn layer noise with `[NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/directed-execution-model#noiselearnerv3) and propagate it into a noise-mitigating observable with [`qiskit-addon-pna`](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna)\n"
"- How to sample randomized circuits with the `QuantumProgram` and [`Executor`](/guides/get-started-with-executor) classes in `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, and combine PNA with TREX and post-selection\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos sundan ang tutorial na ito, dapat maunawaan ng mga user:\n"
"- Ano ang propagated noise absorption (PNA), at paano nito pinagagaan ang two-qubit gate noise sa pamamagitan ng pag-absorb ng learned inverse noise channels sa minisurang observable\n"
"- Paano gamitin ang [`samplomatic`](/guides/directed-execution-model#samplomatic) upang i-box at i-annotate ang circuit layers para sa twirling, basis changes, at noise injection\n"
"- Paano matuto ng layer noise gamit ang `[NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/directed-execution-model#noiselearnerv3) at i-propagate ito sa isang noise-mitigating observable gamit ang [`qiskit-addon-pna`](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-pna)\n"
"- Paano mag-sample ng randomized circuits gamit ang `QuantumProgram` at [`Executor`](/guides/get-started-with-executor) classes sa `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, at pagsamahin ang PNA sa TREX at post-selection\n"

