# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Twirl the two-qubit gate layers and measurements, and find unique layers {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"
msgstr "Twirl the two-qubit gate layers and measurements, and find unique layers {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use `samplomatic` to box the circuit and identify unique two-qubit layers. A box is a construct that groups instructions together so that specific intents or annotations can later be applied uniformly to all gates within the same box.\n"
msgstr "Ginagamit natin ang `samplomatic` upang i-box ang circuit at tukuyin ang mga natatanging two-qubit layer. Ang box ay isang construct na pinagsasama-sama ang mga instruction upang ang mga tiyak na intent o annotation ay mailapat sa parehong paraan sa lahat ng gate sa loob ng parehong box.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we call the method `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, which goes beyond simply identifying two-qubit layers. It performs several key tasks:\n"
msgstr "Dito, tinatawag natin ang method na `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, na lampas pa sa simpleng pagtukoy ng two-qubit layers. Isinasagawa nito ang ilang mahalagang gawain:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups all two-qubit layers in the circuit,\n"
msgstr "Ginugrupo ang lahat ng two-qubit layers sa circuit,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations to those layers,\n"
msgstr "Inilalapat ang mga `Twirl` at `ChangeBasis` annotation sa mga layer na iyon,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups measurement operations into their own boxed sections, and\n"
msgstr "Ginugrupo ang mga measurement operation sa sarili nilang boxed sections, at\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `InjectNoise` annotation to each two-qubit layer.\n"
msgstr "Inilalapat ang `InjectNoise` annotation sa bawat two-qubit layer.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These annotations define how noise, basis changes, and twirling are handled throughout the circuit. They also establish the structure used later for learning and mitigating noise.\n"
msgstr "Tinutukoy ng mga annotation na ito kung paano hinahawakan ang noise, basis changes, at twirling sa buong circuit. Itinatatag din nila ang structure na gagamitin mamaya para sa pagtuto at pagpapagaan ng noise.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The key configuration options are:\n"
msgstr "Ang mga pangunahing configuration option ay:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: Box all two-qubit gate layers and terminal measurements. Single-qubit gates are left-dressed within the boxes.\n"
msgstr "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: I-box ang lahat ng two-qubit gate layers at terminal measurements. Ang single-qubit gates ay left-dressed sa loob ng mga box.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`measure_annotations: all`: Include `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations on the measurement box.\n"
msgstr "`measure_annotations: all`: Isama ang mga `Twirl` at `ChangeBasis` annotation sa measurement box.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`twirling_strategy: active`: Twirl all active qubits in each box containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`twirling_strategy: active`: I-twirl ang lahat ng active na qubit sa bawat box na naglalaman ng entangling gates.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Add `InjectNoise` annotations to all `Twirl`-annotated boxes containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Magdagdag ng `InjectNoise` annotations sa lahat ng `Twirl`-annotated na box na naglalaman ng entangling gates.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: Scale all noise layers equivalently across the circuit.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: I-scale ang lahat ng noise layers nang pantay-pantay sa buong circuit.\n"

